1. Introduction and Project Scope
1.1 Project Problem
Universities may purchase new furniture, computers, laboratory equipment, and other resources while usable assets remain idle in different departments. Without an integrated platform, departments may struggle to identify available resources, coordinate requests and transfers, track maintenance, and maintain accurate asset histories. This can cause unnecessary spending, inefficient resource use, and increased waste.
